      "widgets_values": [
        "A natural-light portrait photograph of a young woman in her mid-twenties standing in a formal garden beside a weathered stone fountain. She has long wavy auburn hair with loose flyaway strands catching the light, fair skin with visible pores, faint freckles across her nose and cheeks, light brown eyes, softly arched brows and a calm half-smile. She wears a cream cable-knit cardigan with chunky stitches over a sage green silk blouse with a soft sheen, and a thin gold chain necklace. She is framed from the waist up, turned slightly toward the camera, one hand resting on the fountain's carved stone rim. Behind her, water spills from the fountain's upper basin into a lower pool, and the garden falls into soft focus: clipped boxwood hedges, climbing pink roses on a white trellis and a pale gravel path. Late afternoon sunlight comes from camera left and puts a warm rim light in her hair. 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, realistic skin texture, natural color, high detail."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "A natural-light portrait photograph of a young woman in her mid-twenties standing in a formal garden beside a weathered stone fountain. She has long wavy auburn hair with loose flyaway strands catching the light, fair skin with visible pores, faint freckles across her nose and cheeks, light brown eyes, softly arched brows and a calm half-smile. She wears a cream cable-knit cardigan with chunky stitches over a sage green silk blouse with a soft sheen, and a thin gold chain necklace. She is framed from the waist up, turned slightly toward the camera, one hand resting on the fountain's carved stone rim. Behind her, water spills from the fountain's upper basin into a lower pool, and the garden falls into soft focus: clipped boxwood hedges, climbing pink roses on a white trellis and a pale gravel path. Late afternoon sunlight comes from camera left and puts a warm rim light in her hair. 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, realistic skin texture, natural color, high detail."
